    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kirusza, the dark magician, has been trying to collect the magic crystals for centuries. Indescribable power is all, Kirusza strives for, no matter, the cost. Disguised as an ordinary ice cream shop, the wizard Skovhir was able to hide the crystals. After Skovhir's death, you were chosen to continue his task. As an apprentice, you have been given a lot of responsibility. Are you able to fulfil this task and stop Kirusza?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make magical ice cream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest magical plants to craft various types of ice cream. Each type of ice cream does a different amount of damage to different enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can defend yourself against Kirusza and the Semacios, using the magical ice cream flavours and your weapon. Stop them in time, before they destroy the ice cream parlour and get to the magic crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kirusza, the dark magician, has been trying to collect the magic crystals for centuries. Indescribable power is all, Kirusza strives for, no matter, the cost. Disguised as an ordinary ice cream shop, the wizard Skovhir was able to hide the crystals. After Skovhir's death, you were chosen to continue his task. As an apprentice, you have been given a lot of responsibility. Are you able to fulfil this task and stop Kirusza?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make magical ice cream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest magical plants to craft various types of ice cream. Each type of ice cream does a different amount of damage to different enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can defend yourself against Kirusza and the Semacios, using the magical ice cream flavours and your weapon. Stop them in time, before they destroy the ice cream parlour and get to the magic crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
